    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="#repName"><rdfs:label>Sales Representative Name</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Full name of the sales representative associated with the booking. Source Table: QuoteToBooking.dim_sales_rep. Source Column: rep_name. Business Definition: Full name of the sales representative associated with the booking.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#SalesRepresentative"/><rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/></owl:DatatypeProperty>
    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="#salesRole"><rdfs:label>Sales Role</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Job role or account responsibility of the sales representative. Source Table: QuoteToBooking.dim_sales_rep. Source Column: sales_role. Business Definition: Job role or account responsibility of the sales representative.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#SalesRepresentative"/><rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/></owl:DatatypeProperty>
    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="#salesTeam"><rdfs:label>Sales Team</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Team or organizational unit to which the sales representative belongs. Source Table: QuoteToBooking.dim_sales_rep. Source Column: sales_team. Business Definition: Team or organizational unit to which the sales representative belongs.</rdfs:comment><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#SalesRepresentative"/><rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/></owl:DatatypeProperty>
